  The spec statements of `ArmadaLean/Nitro/SATP.lean` (`docs/spec-module-design.md`). One
  `Spec` definition per spec theorem, `∀ hypotheses, Claim conclusion`;
  `#check_spec_bindings` fails the build when
  a theorem's type is not definitionally equal to its definition. A change to this
